{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is called a <i>Payneful pair</i> if\n</p>\n<ol type=\"i\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666ab54d9c1d0d6165b579674b99f9daf3bb1c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x + y) = f(x)g(y) + g(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38acbae6753997138cb9653eb5236a1ac4709446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x + y) = g(x)g(y) - f(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50326cbe26e45991d3efed32f590718378529073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> for some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For every Payneful pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbff8c2d6247813a08aab2e4c24e40178d8e1bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/761b9da027f3bd1633e8d6f915fb79a26e6b8c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> (so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/a/1ca2c95be2871904d973edf1d1fd6075c9d7664c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />) into conditions iii and iv, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/f/29f5c3b8fc3e4cbe3a543d270c9977fc3170a9f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = f(0)g(0) + g(0)f(0) = 2g(0) \\times f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"338\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/c/53cee584f114f7c43b327f12caa2b9e45c9e4023.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0) = g(0) \\times g(0) - f(0) \\times f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"259\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From the first equation, either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c59bd9d20bcc9cd7fea79dd1f88c8d6332ce55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e39792244d6286c83ff6d94e2b9acc4c1ff533cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2g(0) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"20\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2459d74e777779f99f93857eccf9ca49043b8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0) = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2459d74e777779f99f93857eccf9ca49043b8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0) = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"72\" height=\"38\" />, then we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4d65f43e2bad1eec157ad039424c2922f3bf08a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4} - f(0) \\times f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"165\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf0bf212c12d87b9b1ab9822b46f7405295c7b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(0))^{2} = \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{2}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77ae3308ebacfb8de8310af35d620c6f4d260a40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(f(0))^{2} = -\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbff8c2d6247813a08aab2e4c24e40178d8e1bcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a real number, meaning that its square cannot be negative. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/1/761b9da027f3bd1633e8d6f915fb79a26e6b8c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/5/6a5f3c90bb2cda853f13eccbef562b378db99ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{f(0) = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"81\" height=\"32\" />. From condition v, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/2815c32fcff4662f49d6a17fad03db187f34147f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a + 0) = f(a)g(0) + g(a)f(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/c/7ac5d07662f1e65510abb2d49caceb9abc202d13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) = f(a)g(0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50326cbe26e45991d3efed32f590718378529073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" />, this means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa10434b4f0c46cf2fbf6c07a3bb16c306aa718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{g(0) = 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"79\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise that the conditions would be met if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/134ee381b2fedb6d1855bc257fa3ae08ffcda57d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = \\sin{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/53242cd1b5e3bc75ec786563ab07fe323403c405.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = \\cos{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" />. Using this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/4/954f3632c40fb72dceed76d29d08eedd5f010c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = \\sin{0} = \\boxed{0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"139\" height=\"25\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93cc7047fc10931cb98b71c174ce02a9e0d2950f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(0) = \\cos{0} = \\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"140\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017142537\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 184/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 948/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7751/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.495      1 2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3\n100.00%   31.495      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37417:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017142537 and revision id 289139. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}